{"title": "Ambushing (Condition)", "pageid": 27892, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ambushing_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp/30px-Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp/45px-Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp/60px-Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp/30px-Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Ambushing</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity will attack as soon as its enemies are within reach. It can only be spotted with a successful <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Check\">Check</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/im